                       <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"cart line details container\">\n                            <p class=\"cart-name\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"cart line item name\">\n                                Revolver\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"cart-unit\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"cart line unit price\">\n                                32.000 $ / Stück\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"quantity-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"cart quantity row\">\n                                <span class=\"quantity-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"quantity stepper control\">\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"decrease quantity button\">\n                                        −\n                                    </span>\n                                    <strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"current quantity value\">\n                                        1\n                                    </strong>\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-3-1-3\" data-name=\"increase quantity button\">\n                                        +\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"quantity-hint\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"quantity hint label\">\n                                    Menge\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <strong class=\"cart-line-total\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"cart line total price\">\n                            32.000 $\n                        </strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"cart-summary\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"cart summary container\">\n                        <div class=\"summary-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"cart summary line (items)\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"summary items label\">\n                                Positionen\n                            </span>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"summary items value\">\n                                1\n                            </strong>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"summary-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"cart summary line (subtotal)\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"summary subtotal label\">\n                                Zwischensumme\n                            </span>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"summary subtotal value\">\n                                32.000 $\n                            </strong>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"summary-row total\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"cart summary line (total)\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"summary total label\">\n                                Gesamtsumme\n                            </span>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"summary total value\">\n                                32.000 $\n                            </strong>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <a class=\"checkout-button\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"checkout button\" href=\"#bestellung\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"checkout arrow icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        Zur Bestellung\n                    </a>\n                </section>\n                <section aria-label=\"Anzeige\" class=\"ad-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"advertising panel\">\n                    <img alt=\"Werbefläche im OLYMP Shop\" class=\"ad-image\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"ad image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/img/werbung1.png\"/>\n                    <div class=\"ad-copy\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"ad copy container\">\n                        <span class=\"ad-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"ad label (Anzeige)\">\n                            Anzeige\n                        </span>\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"ad headline\">\n                            Werbefläche im OLYMP Shop\n                        </strong>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"ad description text\">\n                            Ein kompakter Hinweis — nach Merkliste, Warenkorb und Produktangebot.\n                        </p>\n                        <a data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"ad link with arrow\" href=\"#shop\">\n                            Mehr erfahren\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"ad arrow up-right icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </aside>\n        </div>\n        <footer class=\"site-footer\" data-kid=\"1-2-3\" data-name=\"site footer\">\n            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"footer brand text\">\n                OLYMP SHOP · Preise in $\n            </span>\n            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"footer functional note\">\n                Merkliste und Wunschartikel sind getrennte Funktionen\n            </span>\n        </footer>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
